    "detailed_description": "<h1>Add to Wishlist now!</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1630180/extras/b0e7b52645b53d873ed558ad402e57ba.poster.avif?t=1622199107\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1630180/extras/b0e7b52645b53d873ed558ad402e57ba.webm?t=1622199107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1630180/extras/b0e7b52645b53d873ed558ad402e57ba.mp4?t=1622199107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1630180/extras/99208c852d6c0691dfa36d4e59ddb075.poster.avif?t=1622199107\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1630180/extras/99208c852d6c0691dfa36d4e59ddb075.webm?t=1622199107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1630180/extras/99208c852d6c0691dfa36d4e59ddb075.mp4?t=1622199107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>DISCLAIMER!!!!: THE GAME IS A SHORT EXPERIENCE. <br><br><strong>The hidden game society</strong> is a digital escape room experience.<br><br>Explore the room in search of a way out. <br>After responding to their invite, you find yourself trapped in this mysterious club. <br>Can you find your way out? <br>Tackle this test, succeed, and your membership is assured.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1630180/extras/c21a9623f138766aef680c8f0af20d22.poster.avif?t=1622199107\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1630180/extras/c21a9623f138766aef680c8f0af20d22.webm?t=1622199107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1630180/extras/c21a9623f138766aef680c8f0af20d22.mp4?t=1622199107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Hidden mechanisms, riddles, and secret combinations.<br></li><li> Simple controls, easy to play.<br></li><li> First person view. Full immersion.<br></li><li> Engaging atmosphere. </li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1630180/extras/4253159d7e9b56346616bb1b903ff6d7.poster.avif?t=1622199107\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1630180/extras/4253159d7e9b56346616bb1b903ff6d7.webm?t=1622199107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1630180/extras/4253159d7e9b56346616bb1b903ff6d7.mp4?t=1622199107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
